meta {
  name: fcp-sfd-object-processor
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
}

docs {
  Requests against the fcp-sfd-object-processor API. Mirrors
  docs/openapi/v1.json in the fcp-sfd-object-processor repository. Check
  against that spec if a request is rejected.

  The collection sends the bearer token in ACCESS_TOKEN on every request.
  Health check and Process upload callback override this to no auth, because
  the service disables authentication on /health and /api/v1/callback. The
  requests that need a token are grouped under "Authenticated requests".

  Run Get Access Token first. Its post-response script stores the token in
  ACCESS_TOKEN for the rest of the collection to use.
}
